# Poisons for Horde Rogues: The Shattered Salute (2460) and Deep Cover (2458)
# from Shenthul in Orgrimmar's Cleft of Shadow to Taskmaster Fizzule at the
# Venture Co. tower in the northern Barrens; Mission: Possible But Not
# Probable (2478) there; then Hinott's Assistance (2479, 2480) to Serge
# Hinott in Tarren Mill.
# Forever change (Forever's Rogue class quest list,
# data/local/quest-audit/): Hinott's Assistance
# (2480) now teaches Poisons (Forever moved it from the trainer onto this
# quest). Rewards from the same list: Fizzule's Whistle (Deep Cover), Recipe:
# Thistle Tea (Mission: Possible), Hinott's Oil (2480).
# Mission: Possible needs Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix's head, and Gallywix
# is an elite (npcs.json): bring a friend. Forever's quest data files it as a group
# quest. No Gallywix, no Poisons: 2479 needs 2478 turned in.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the givers,
# drops and places; travel.json for the flight points.
# horde/04-the-barrens and horde/06-hillsbrad-foothills carry this chain on
# the route (2478 onwards optional there); this guide is for anyone off it or
# coming back with a group for Gallywix.

step The Shattered Salute
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 20 Shenthul stands in the Cleft of Shadow, the canyon under the Valley of Strength. Target him and type /salute.
  level 20
  accept 2460                                 -- Shenthul
  complete 2460                               -- /salute Shenthul
  turnin 2460
  accept 2458                                 -- Deep Cover: keep the Flare Gun

step Taskmaster Fizzule
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly to the Crossroads and head north to the Venture Co. tower north of the Sludge Fen. In sight of the tower, fire the Flare Gun twice, then /salute Taskmaster Fizzule before he attacks you.
  use 8051 @55.4,5.6                          -- Flare Gun, twice, in sight of the tower
  turnin 2458 reward 8066                     -- Taskmaster Fizzule: Fizzule's Whistle
  accept 2478

step Mission: Possible But Not Probable
  tip Stay stealthed. Foreman Silixiz carries the tower key; Gallywix (elite) and his lockbox are at the top of the tower. Kill two each of the drones, patrollers and lookouts around it.
  collect 8072 quest 2478.5                   -- Silixiz's Tower Key: Foreman Silixiz
  kill 7310 quest 2478.1                      -- Mutated Venture Co. Drone
  kill 7308 quest 2478.3                      -- Venture Co. Patroller
  kill 7307 quest 2478.2                      -- Venture Co. Lookout
  collect 8074 quest 2478.4                   -- Gallywix's Head: Grand Foreman Puzik Gallywix (elite)
  collect 8073 quest 2478.6                   -- Cache of Zanzil's Altered Mixture: Gallywix's Lockbox

step Back to Shenthul
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Fly back to Orgrimmar.
  turnin 2478 reward 18160                    -- Shenthul: Recipe: Thistle Tea
  accept 2479

step Serge Hinott
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Take the zeppelin from Orgrimmar to the Undercity and head south through Silverpine Forest to Tarren Mill in Hillsbrad. Serge Hinott stands in Tarren Mill; wait beside him while he brews the cure.
  getfp "Tarren Mill" optional
  turnin 2479                                 -- Serge Hinott
  accept 2480
  complete 2480                               -- Wait for the cure
  turnin 2480 reward 8095                     -- Serge Hinott: Poisons
